<BaseLayout title="Web design and local SEO for businesses" description="We design fast, professional websites and local SEO foundations that help businesses turn searches into calls, messages, and real opportunities." locale="en" path="en">
<section class="hero agency-hero"><div class="container hero-split"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Web design + local SEO for businesses</span><h1>A website built to <span>bring you opportunities.</span></h1><p class="lede">We design fast, professional websites built to convert. Then we create the local SEO foundation that helps more customers find you when they search for what you sell.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="mailto:info@quisqueyatech.com?subject=Web%20%2F%20Local%20SEO%20project">Start my project →</a><a class="btn outline" href="#work">See our work</a></div><div class="notes"><span>Responsive design</span><span>Local SEO from the architecture</span><span>EN / ES</span></div></div><div class="growth-demo" aria-label="Illustrative connected digital presence"><div class="demo-label">Example digital ecosystem</div><div class="browser-card"><div class="browser-top"><span></span><span></span><span></span><small>yourbusiness.com</small></div><div class="browser-body"><div class="demo-brand">Your business</div><div class="demo-headline">The service your customer is looking for.</div><div class="demo-copy">A clear offer, visible call to action, and fast mobile experience.</div><div class="demo-button">Request service</div></div></div><div class="signal-grid"><div><strong>Website</strong><span>Converts visits</span></div><div><strong>Local SEO</strong><span>Captures intent</span></div><div><strong>Google</strong><span>Builds presence</span></div><div><strong>Measurement</strong><span>Shows what works</span></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="proof-strip"><div class="container"><span>We design for businesses that need to be found, understood, and contacted.</span><div class="proof-items"><strong>Puerto Plata</strong><strong>Dominican Republic</strong><strong>International clients</strong></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head center-head"><span class="eyebrow">What we do</span><h2>Everything needed to build a digital presence that works.</h2><p>We do not start with a template. We start with your business, your services, and how a customer decides to contact you.</p></div><div class="service-grid">{[["Web design","Custom, fast, mobile-ready websites built around a clear commercial action.","/en/solutions/web-design","01"],["Local SEO","Architecture, content, and local signals designed around relevant service and location searches.","/en/solutions/local-seo","02"],["Maintenance","New pages, performance improvements, measurement, and support after launch.","/en/solutions/maintenance","03"],["Google Business","Structure and recommendations that align your website with your local Google presence.","/en/solutions/local-seo","04"],["Analytics & conversion","A measurement foundation for pages, channels, and actions that generate real interest.","/en/how-we-work","05"],["Enterprise","Automation, AI agents, integrations, and discovery for more complex operations.","/en/enterprise","06"]].map(([t,p,h,n])=><a class="service-card" href={h}><span class="service-number">{n}</span><h3>{t}</h3><p>{p}</p><span class="service-link">Explore →</span></a>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section alt" id="work"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Our work</span><h2>Digital experiences built for real businesses.</h2><p>We show real projects without attaching results we cannot verify. You can judge the work by the design and execution itself.</p></div><div class="work-grid"><a class="work-card" href="https://thevocalroomacademy.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><div class="work-browser"><div class="browser-top"><span></span><span></span><span></span><small>thevocalroomacademy.com</small></div><div class="work-canvas vocal-room"><strong>The Vocal Room Academy</strong><span>Education · Conversion · Forms</span></div></div><div class="work-meta"><h3>The Vocal Room Academy</h3><p>A website focused on presenting programs and workshops and converting interest into registrations.</p><span>View project ↗</span></div></a><a class="work-card" href="https://luxuryhomerooms.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><div class="work-browser"><div class="browser-top"><span></span><span></span><span></span><small>luxuryhomerooms.com</small></div><div class="work-canvas luxury-rooms"><strong>Luxury Home Rooms</strong><span>Hospitality · Visual presentation · Booking</span></div></div><div class="work-meta"><h3>Luxury Home Rooms</h3><p>A digital presence designed to present a hospitality offer with a polished visual experience.</p><span>View project ↗</span></div></a><a class="work-card" href="https://connectionsrd.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><div class="work-browser"><div class="browser-top"><span></span><span></span><span></span><small>connectionsrd.com</small></div><div class="work-canvas connections"><strong>Connections RD</strong><span>Services · Brand · Digital presence</span></div></div><div class="work-meta"><h3>Connections RD</h3><p>A web project focused on explaining services and establishing a clear professional presence.</p><span>View project ↗</span></div></a></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container why-layout"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Why QuisqueyaTech</span><h2>Strong design with technical and commercial discipline.</h2><p>An effective website needs more than a good homepage. It must load fast, work well on mobile, explain the offer, and create a solid foundation for growth.</p><a class="btn outline" href="/en/how-we-work">See our process</a></div><div class="why-grid">{[["Mobile first","We design around the device many customers will use to find you."],["Performance","We use a modern static architecture to reduce complexity and improve speed."],["SEO from day one","Service structure, URLs, titles, and content are part of the design, not an afterthought."],["Direct attention","You work close to the person making strategy, design, and technology decisions."]].map(([t,p])=><article><div class="check-mark">✓</div><h3>{t}</h3><p>{p}</p></article>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section dark"><div class="container measure-layout"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Designed to measure</span><h2>Your website should help you understand what is working.</h2><p>We do not display invented metrics. We build the instrumentation needed to measure visits, forms, calls, clicks, and other important actions when the project requires it.</p></div><div class="metric-demo"><div class="demo-label light-label">Examples of signals we can instrument</div><div class="metric-list"><div><span>Visibility</span><strong>Searches and landing pages</strong></div><div><span>Interest</span><strong>Call and WhatsApp clicks</strong></div><div><span>Conversion</span><strong>Forms and inquiries</strong></div><div><span>Growth</span><strong>Pages and services with demand</strong></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section alt"><div class="container"><div class="section-head center-head"><span class="eyebrow">How we work</span><h2>From idea to a site ready to compete.</h2></div><div class="steps">{[["01","Discovery","Understand services, customers, market, competitors, and commercial goals."],["02","Strategy","Define architecture, content, SEO, navigation, and calls to action."],["03","Design & development","Build the experience, connect forms, and optimize performance."],["04","Launch & improve","Publish, measure, and prioritize improvements from real usage."]].map(([n,t,p])=><div class="step"><strong>{n}</strong><h3>{t}</h3><p>{p}</p></div>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container enterprise-callout"><div><span class="eyebrow">Enterprise</span><h2>When the problem goes beyond the website.</h2><p>For companies that need discovery, automation, AI agents, or integrations, we keep a separate Enterprise offer so both customer journeys remain clear.</p></div><a class="btn outline" href="/en/enterprise">Explore Enterprise →</a></div></section>
<section class="section dark signature-cta"><div class="container" style="max-width:820px;text-align:center"><span class="eyebrow">Ready to start?</span><h2>Let's build a website your business can use to grow.</h2><p>Tell us what you sell, where you compete, and what you need your digital presence to do.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="mailto:info@quisqueyatech.com?subject=Web%20%2F%20Local%20SEO%20project">Start my project →</a><a class="btn outline" href="/en/solutions">View services</a></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
